#==============================================================================================
#
#   event - DOM::Event: creation, the event flags, the event path and composedPath()
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/DOM/Event.cpp (lines 1-277) with the inline functions of
#       Event.h (lines 1-198): the inner event creation steps, the accessors and flag setters
#       the dispatch algorithm uses, appending to an event path, initializing an event and the
#       composed path. Event::initialize's unforgeable `isTrusted` attribute belongs to the JS
#       wrapper (phase 3).
